Package: symmetrichal
Type: Project
Title: Covariate Coding and Causal Estimates with Highly Adaptive Lasso
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Gaurav", "Sood", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "gsood07@gmail.com")
Description: Coding sensitivity of causal estimates using Highly Adaptive Lasso
    nuisances, with canonical-orientation and symmetric-dictionary remedies.
    Gaussian and binomial zero-order implementations use minimum-norm lasso
    solution selection, explicit cross-validation and numerical optimality
    checks. Includes first-order software comparisons, mathematical results
    and reproducible prediction and causal simulation studies.
